# Cinema Portfolio Environment Variables
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: External Media CDN Base URL (without trailing slash)
# Leave empty to serve all media directly from Vercel static assets (/public/projects/)
# Example (if migrating to Cloudflare R2 in the future):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MEDIA_URL=https://media.tommasoruella.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_MEDIA_URL=
